    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Delve into the World of Absence of Light: Embark on an Epic Action RPG Adventure in Cloudia! \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Immerse yourself in the captivating realm of Absence of Light, set in the mesmerizing world of Cloudia! Prepare to be mesmerized by a medieval-inspired journey, where mystical treasures and powerful weapons await your discovery. Take control of a heroic character and forge your arsenal with diverse weapons, each possessing unique attributes to strategically unleash devastating attacks upon the forces of darkness that now rule the once-glorious Old Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Unleash the Power of Action RPG Gameplay: face challenging battles, and uncover hidden secrets in an immersive gaming experience that will keep you hooked for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Discover the Enchanting Realm of Cloudia: Traverse through the charming village area, interact with intriguing characters, and collect valuable items that will aid you in your quest to restore light to Cloudia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Master Formidable Combos: Choose your weapons wisely and create powerful combinations to conquer the darkness and bring back the radiance to Cloudia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Unravel the Prologue: The fate of Cloudia hangs in the balance, and only your courage can shatter the sinister grasp of the shadows. Are you ready to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Join the Gaming Community: Connect with fellow adventurers, share tips, and showcase your achievements in Cloudia. Get ready for epic battles and unforgettable moments!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Delve into the World of Absence of Light: Embark on an Epic Action RPG Adventure in Cloudia! \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2e9387b01533351fdcc603ec32907a5f.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Immerse yourself in the captivating realm of Absence of Light, set in the mesmerizing world of Cloudia! Prepare to be mesmerized by a medieval-inspired journey, where mystical treasures and powerful weapons await your discovery. Take control of a heroic character and forge your arsenal with diverse weapons, each possessing unique attributes to strategically unleash devastating attacks upon the forces of darkness that now rule the once-glorious Old Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/ced419901dc635da5b85823810f258a7.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Unleash the Power of Action RPG Gameplay: face challenging battles, and uncover hidden secrets in an immersive gaming experience that will keep you hooked for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/2fe744752e8624d4ca19f147d6b72146.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Discover the Enchanting Realm of Cloudia: Traverse through the charming village area, interact with intriguing characters, and collect valuable items that will aid you in your quest to restore light to Cloudia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/76a27a0e76633132e2959595294e799e.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Master Formidable Combos: Choose your weapons wisely and create powerful combinations to conquer the darkness and bring back the radiance to Cloudia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.poster.avif?t=1748371483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.webm?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536710/extras/f5a682e4e1823d6dfac5d56c72bf3df2.mp4?t=1748371483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Unravel the Prologue: The fate of Cloudia hangs in the balance, and only your courage can shatter the sinister grasp of the shadows. Are you ready to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Join the Gaming Community: Connect with fellow adventurers, share tips, and showcase your achievements in Cloudia. Get ready for epic battles and unforgettable moments!</p>",
    "short_description": "Absence of Light is an action RPG inspired by the medieval era and Souls-like games. A skeleton has been incarnated in another world, on a mission to travel between realms and defeat dark entities in order to restore the light.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Arabic, Greek, Indonesian, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Danish, Finnish, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Swedish, Czech, Ukrainian, Bulgarian, Spanish - Latin America, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt's OK, the difficulty is medium to high, and there is Chinese translation\u201d<br />\r\n4/5 \u2013 \u597d<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI can really tell a lot of care and effort went into this, the camera does cause a bit of issue though, I think controller support would go a long way but a fixed over the shoulder view could be welcome as well, I look forward to future updates\u201d<br />\r\n4/5 \u2013 dyhbcdryhv<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cFinally a souls-like mobile game :)\u201d<br />\r\n5/5 \u2013 Seven Evanson<br />\r\n",
